WEBVTT

1
00:00:43.625 --> 00:00:47.500
In the first eighteen verses of Chapter 14,

2
00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:49.583
Lord Krishna explained actions

3
00:00:49.583 --> 00:00:51.416
performed under sattva, rajas,

4
00:00:51.416 --> 00:00:54.791
and tamas, and their results.

5
00:00:54.791 --> 00:00:57.708
Now in verses 14.19 and 14.20,

6
00:00:57.708 --> 00:01:02.083
Lord Krishna explains a deeper
truth to the seeker –

7
00:01:02.083 --> 00:01:07.250
He explains - how the seeker can
rise above these gunas.

8
00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:09.166
Lord Krishna explains –

9
00:01:09.166 --> 00:01:12.416
all actions are performed by the
gunas of prakriti.

10
00:01:12.416 --> 00:01:14.791
The soul desires

11
00:01:14.791 --> 00:01:17.666
and acts through the body,

12
00:01:17.666 --> 00:01:20.916
but it is not the sole doer.

13
00:01:20.916 --> 00:01:23.166
And when the knowledge comes

14
00:01:23.166 --> 00:01:26.333
that Lord Krishna is beyond these gunas,
the seeker

15
00:01:26.333 --> 00:01:29.500
attains His spiritual nature.

16
00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:32.208
This realisation frees the seeker from
the cycle of birth,

17
00:01:32.208 --> 00:01:36.125
death, and old age.

18
00:01:36.125 --> 00:01:39.083
And then, even while living,

19
00:01:39.083 --> 00:01:42.625
they experience spiritual joy.

20
00:01:47.291 --> 00:01:48.541
Now listen,

21
00:01:48.541 --> 00:01:51.791
In this world, all actions of body,
speech, and mind

22
00:01:51.791 --> 00:01:55.333
are directed by the three gunas.

23
00:01:55.333 --> 00:01:56.125
But

24
00:01:56.125 --> 00:01:59.708
When we identify with the body and mind,

25
00:01:59.708 --> 00:02:01.833
we mistakenly think

26
00:02:01.833 --> 00:02:04.000
that we are doing everything ourselves.

27
00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:07.250
But when the seeker understands

28
00:02:07.250 --> 00:02:10.583
that actions truly arise from the gunas,

29
00:02:10.583 --> 00:02:14.000
and also realises that Lord Krishna is beyond

30
00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:15.708
these gunas –

31
00:02:15.708 --> 00:02:18.416
they rise above the gunas’ influence

32
00:02:18.416 --> 00:02:22.041
and attain His spiritual nature.

33
00:02:22.041 --> 00:02:24.125
This is true liberation.

34
00:02:24.125 --> 00:02:28.083
It is like a puppet that comes to understand

35
00:02:28.083 --> 00:02:30.041
that all its movements

36
00:02:30.041 --> 00:02:31.708
are happening through strings.

37
00:02:31.708 --> 00:02:33.958
When this realisation comes,

38
00:02:33.958 --> 00:02:35.750
it naturally

39
00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:38.125
desires to be free.

40
00:02:38.125 --> 00:02:41.375
In the same way, when we recognise

41
00:02:41.375 --> 00:02:43.958
that the gunas are directing our actions

42
00:02:43.958 --> 00:02:46.958
and take shelter in Lord Krishna,

43
00:02:46.958 --> 00:02:50.500
we become free from their influence.

44
00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:51.583
Further,

45
00:02:51.583 --> 00:02:54.375
In verse 14.20, Lord Krishna further explains

46
00:02:54.375 --> 00:02:57.875
that the seeker who crosses beyond these gunas

47
00:02:57.875 --> 00:02:59.458
is not only freed from birth,

48
00:02:59.458 --> 00:03:02.541
death, and sorrow.

49
00:03:02.541 --> 00:03:03.708
They also begin

50
00:03:03.708 --> 00:03:05.041
to experience spiritual

51
00:03:05.041 --> 00:03:07.458
joy in this very life.

52
00:03:07.458 --> 00:03:10.083
Through spiritual knowledge and devotion,

53
00:03:10.083 --> 00:03:12.541
they are released from the gunas’ grip

54
00:03:12.541 --> 00:03:15.625
and enjoy lasting peace.

55
00:03:20.250 --> 00:03:22.583
Have you experienced this?

56
00:03:22.583 --> 00:03:25.041
Sometimes you feel light, hopeful,

57
00:03:25.041 --> 00:03:28.458
and full of clarity.

58
00:03:28.458 --> 00:03:29.166
And sometimes,

59
00:03:29.166 --> 00:03:30.916
without any reason,

60
00:03:30.916 --> 00:03:33.416
you feel irritable, restless, or heavy.

61
00:03:33.416 --> 00:03:37.625
But have you ever paused and asked –

62
00:03:37.625 --> 00:03:40.375
‘Why am I feeling this way?’

63
00:03:40.375 --> 00:03:46.250
You are not defined by your feelings.

64
00:03:46.250 --> 00:03:47.625
These waves of emotion

65
00:03:47.625 --> 00:03:50.541
rise under the influence of the three gunas –

66
00:03:50.541 --> 00:03:53.291
whether positive or negative.

67
00:03:53.291 --> 00:03:56.000
When sattva Guna is dominant,

68
00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:58.541
you are calm.

69
00:03:58.541 --> 00:04:00.166
When Rajo Guna is active,

70
00:04:00.166 --> 00:04:02.833
you rush or become anxious.

71
00:04:02.833 --> 00:04:06.458
And when Tamo Guna increases, you sink –

72
00:04:06.458 --> 00:04:09.875
confused and burdened.

73
00:04:09.875 --> 00:04:13.333
But none of these is you.

74
00:04:13.333 --> 00:04:18.958
Just as clouds pass through a clear sky,

75
00:04:18.958 --> 00:04:21.375
these moods too pass through

76
00:04:21.375 --> 00:04:24.583
your consciousness.

77
00:04:24.583 --> 00:04:28.208
If you think you are the clouds,

78
00:04:28.208 --> 00:04:29.958
you get lost.

79
00:04:29.958 --> 00:04:34.041
But if you remain the sky,

80
00:04:34.041 --> 00:04:36.500
you stay free.

81
00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:37.666
So the next time

82
00:04:37.666 --> 00:04:41.375
a mood comes and shifts,

83
00:04:41.375 --> 00:04:44.000
pause and ask –

84
00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:46.958
‘Is this truly me,

85
00:04:46.958 --> 00:04:51.833
or just a guna passing through?’

86
00:04:51.833 --> 00:04:53.166
This one question

87
00:04:53.166 --> 00:04:58.708
can transform your entire inner world.

88
00:04:58.708 --> 00:05:00.041
Reflect on this.

89
00:05:04.666 --> 00:05:06.166
Perhaps

90
00:05:06.166 --> 00:05:09.416
you have tried very hard to change someone

91
00:05:09.416 --> 00:05:12.125
at home –

92
00:05:12.125 --> 00:05:16.291
asked them to be less angry,

93
00:05:16.291 --> 00:05:18.875
to be more responsible,

94
00:05:18.875 --> 00:05:22.083
or to understand others’ feelings.

95
00:05:22.083 --> 00:05:24.000
right?

96
00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:27.625
But pause and think honestly –

97
00:05:27.625 --> 00:05:31.291
how often did you succeed?

98
00:05:31.291 --> 00:05:33.458
Peace in the family

99
00:05:33.458 --> 00:05:36.416
does not come from correcting others.

100
00:05:36.416 --> 00:05:38.166
It comes

101
00:05:38.166 --> 00:05:43.125
when you yourself rise above the gunas.

102
00:05:43.125 --> 00:05:46.666
When you live in sattva Guna,

103
00:05:46.666 --> 00:05:49.708
your clarity and peace

104
00:05:49.708 --> 00:05:54.041
naturally spread light in the home.

105
00:05:54.041 --> 00:05:58.000
When you give up the controlling
tendency of Rajo Guna

106
00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:01.333
or the neglect of Tamo Guna,

107
00:06:01.333 --> 00:06:03.583
the people around you

108
00:06:03.583 --> 00:06:06.083
feel safe.

109
00:06:06.083 --> 00:06:09.000
They feel heard.

110
00:06:09.000 --> 00:06:10.791
They are not constantly judged

111
00:06:10.791 --> 00:06:14.541
for their shortcomings.

112
00:06:14.541 --> 00:06:16.375
This shift in atmosphere

113
00:06:16.375 --> 00:06:20.708
also inspires them to move toward sattva.

114
00:06:20.708 --> 00:06:23.666
As long as you act from the same gunas

115
00:06:23.666 --> 00:06:27.208
that are influencing others,

116
00:06:27.208 --> 00:06:31.750
you will only add fuel to the fire of reaction.

117
00:06:31.750 --> 00:06:32.500
But

118
00:06:32.500 --> 00:06:34.250
when you respond from a place

119
00:06:34.250 --> 00:06:36.333
that is above the gunas,

120
00:06:36.333 --> 00:06:39.458
your words carry depth,

121
00:06:39.458 --> 00:06:41.125
not heat.

122
00:06:41.125 --> 00:06:44.041
Your silence becomes a presence,

123
00:06:44.041 --> 00:06:45.958
not an absence.

124
00:06:45.958 --> 00:06:47.458
So

125
00:06:47.458 --> 00:06:51.583
stop trying to change others’ nature.

126
00:06:51.583 --> 00:06:54.458
Elevate your own state.

127
00:06:54.458 --> 00:06:56.125
This one step

128
00:06:56.125 --> 00:07:02.333
can change the entire atmosphere
of your home.

129
00:07:02.333 --> 00:07:05.291
This is real influence.

130
00:07:05.291 --> 00:07:06.625
Reflect on this.

131
00:07:11.083 --> 00:07:14.000
Have you ever noticed?

132
00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:15.583
Some weeks

133
00:07:15.583 --> 00:07:19.125
you work with full energy –

134
00:07:19.125 --> 00:07:23.333
chasing every target like a machine.

135
00:07:23.333 --> 00:07:27.083
And then in another week, even replying

136
00:07:27.083 --> 00:07:31.500
to a simple email feels like a burden.

137
00:07:31.500 --> 00:07:34.083
Sometimes you are sharp and focused,

138
00:07:34.083 --> 00:07:38.541
sometimes your mind becomes
hazy and restless.

139
00:07:38.541 --> 00:07:40.916
What is happening here?

140
00:07:40.916 --> 00:07:44.875
This is all the influence of the gunas.

141
00:07:44.875 --> 00:07:47.625
When Rajo Guna dominates,

142
00:07:47.625 --> 00:07:50.416
you overwork,

143
00:07:50.416 --> 00:07:54.333
constantly running after results
and recognition –

144
00:07:54.333 --> 00:07:58.958
but end up with only exhaustion.

145
00:07:58.958 --> 00:08:01.958
When Tamo Guna increases,

146
00:08:01.958 --> 00:08:04.791
the habit of postponing comes,

147
00:08:04.791 --> 00:08:08.125
priorities are forgotten, and within

148
00:08:08.125 --> 00:08:12.000
a feeling of giving up rises.

149
00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:16.666
But when sattva Guna is present,

150
00:08:16.666 --> 00:08:20.458
clarity comes to the mind, balance

151
00:08:20.458 --> 00:08:24.500
and peace are maintained, and
the sense of purpose

152
00:08:24.500 --> 00:08:26.041
becomes firm.

153
00:08:26.041 --> 00:08:28.708
If you do not recognise

154
00:08:28.708 --> 00:08:32.500
which guna is working within you,

155
00:08:32.500 --> 00:08:34.000
you will keep

156
00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:36.166
reacting again and again –

157
00:08:36.166 --> 00:08:39.000
sometimes overworking,

158
00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:42.916
sometimes avoiding responsibilities,
or sometimes

159
00:08:42.916 --> 00:08:45.916
getting frustrated with yourself and others.

160
00:08:45.916 --> 00:08:49.708
But when you recognise the guna,

161
00:08:49.708 --> 00:08:53.208
you can respond with wisdom.

162
00:08:53.208 --> 00:08:56.833
So before every decision, pause

163
00:08:56.833 --> 00:08:59.500
and ask yourself –

164
00:08:59.500 --> 00:09:03.166
is this choice coming from clarity,

165
00:09:03.166 --> 00:09:07.500
from some compulsion, or from confusion?

166
00:09:07.500 --> 00:09:11.958
Recognising the guna changes everything.

167
00:09:11.958 --> 00:09:14.625
This is the path

168
00:09:14.625 --> 00:09:18.375
out of the cycle of exhaustion –

169
00:09:18.375 --> 00:09:22.916
not by doing more or less, but by rising above

170
00:09:22.916 --> 00:09:26.708
the influence of the gunas.

171
00:09:26.708 --> 00:09:28.000
Reflect on this.
